@startuml implement-plan-task
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F4F6F8
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #888
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #888
skinparam ArrowColor #444
<style>
activityDiagram {
  .gate {
    BackgroundColor #FFF6DD
    LineColor #B8860B
  }
}
</style>

start
:Gate: designs settled,
findings actioned;<<gate>>
:Gate: every module green,
baseline counts kept;<<gate>>
if (shared/plan.md?) then (yes)
  :Seam pipeline, alone:
  artifact, wiring, call sites;
  :Gate: seam modules
  compile and are green;<<gate>>
endif
fork
  :pipeline for plan 1;
  note right
    at most as many at once
    as your **agent.md** allows
  end note
fork again
  :pipeline for plan 2;
fork again
  :…;
end fork
:Gate: no open item
in any plan;<<gate>>
:review/findings.md;
:archive task directory;
:commit;
:run follow-up;
note right
  the list in your
  **follow-up.md**, in order
end note
stop
@enduml
